	WebSearchOff: Off
	StatusConnecting: Connecting to AI
	StatusSearchRequested: Requesting API web search (unconfirmed)
	StatusSearching: Searching the web
	StatusSearchCompleted: API search completed; waiting for reply
	StatusSearchFailed: API web search failed
	StatusGenerating: AI is generating
	StatusGeneratingUnverified: AI is generating (web search unconfirmed)
	StatusCompleted: Reply completed
	StatusCompletedWithSearch: Reply completed (API search confirmed)
	StatusCompletedUnverified: Reply completed (web search unconfirmed)
	StatusCompletedSearchFailed: Reply completed (API search failed)
	StatusSearchRequestFailed: Search request failed; check support or turn it off
	StatusFailed: Request failed
}
